  <section class="hero-section">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <span class="banner-pill">Our Residential Dumpster Rentals</span>

        <h1 class="hero-title">
          Residential Dumpster Rentals In Metro Detroit - Clear Clutter & Reclaim Your Space
        </h1>

        <p style="font-size:1.15rem; color:#e2e8f0; margin-bottom:25px;">
          We deliver residential roll-off dumpsters fast so you can stay on schedule, protect your driveway, and clear out home clutter without stress.
        </p>

        <ul class="hero-features">
          <li>
            <div class="check-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M27 4l-15 15-7-7-5 5 12 12 20-20z"/></svg></div>
            Driveway-safe placement to protect your property
