  <section class="faq-section" id="faq">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-grid">
        <div class="faq-column">
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question">
              <span>Will my residential dumpster have a back door?</span>
              <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M16.609 22.389c-0.37 0.37-0.97 0.37-1.34 0l-9.659-9.659c-0.37-0.37-0.37-0.97 0-1.34l0.447-0.447c0.37-0.37 0.97-0.37 1.34 0l8.542 8.542 8.542-8.542c0.37-0.37 0.97-0.37 1.34 0l0.447 0.447c0.37 0.37 0.37 0.97 0 1.34l-9.659 9.659z"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <div class="faq-answer-content">
                Yes! All Dumpsters 911 roll-off dumpsters feature heavy-duty hinged rear doors that open fully, allowing you to walk heavy furniture, drywall, and appliances directly into the dumpster.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question">
              <span>Will a dumpster damage my residential driveway?</span>
              <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M16.609 22.389c-0.37 0.37-0.97 0.37-1.34 0l-9.659-9.659c-0.37-0.37-0.37-0.97 0-1.34l0.447-0.447c0.37-0.37 0.97-0.37 1.34 0l8.542 8.542 8.542-8.542c0.37-0.37 0.97-0.37 1.34 0l0.447 0.447c0.37 0.37 0.37 0.97 0 1.34l-9.659 9.659z"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <div class="faq-answer-content">
                No. We take driveway protection seriously. Our containers feature heavy rubber wheels and our drivers lay down protective wooden boards upon request to ensure zero damage to your concrete or asphalt.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-column">
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question">
              <span>How long can I keep the residential dumpster?</span>
              <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M16.609 22.389c-0.37 0.37-0.97 0.37-1.34 0l-9.659-9.659c-0.37-0.37-0.37-0.97 0-1.34l0.447-0.447c0.37-0.37 0.97-0.37 1.34 0l8.542 8.542 8.542-8.542c0.37-0.37 0.97-0.37 1.34 0l0.447 0.447c0.37 0.37 0.37 0.97 0 1.34l-9.659 9.659z"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <div class="faq-answer-content">
                Our standard residential rental period is 7 days, but we offer flexible rental extensions if your home project takes longer than anticipated.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question">
              <span>Do I need to be home when the dumpster is delivered?</span>
              <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M16.609 22.389c-0.37 0.37-0.97 0.37-1.34 0l-9.659-9.659c-0.37-0.37-0.37-0.97 0-1.34l0.447-0.447c0.37-0.37 0.97-0.37 1.34 0l8.542 8.542 8.542-8.542c0.37-0.37 0.97-0.37 1.34 0l0.447 0.447c0.37 0.37 0.37 0.97 0 1.34l-9.659 9.659z"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <div class="faq-answer-content">
                Not necessarily! As long as your placement instructions are clear and your driveway is clear of vehicles or obstructions, our driver can drop off the dumpster without you needing to take off work.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
